PREVIEW.emailTemplates=[{id:'email-template-1',nameZh:'付款要求',nameEn:'Payment request',subjectZh:'Beamal 課程付款資料 · {{student_name}}',subjectEn:'Beamal payment details · {{student_name}}',bodyZh:'你好，{{student_name}} 的課程資料已準備好。\n課程：{{course_name}}\n金額：{{amount}}\n請登入平台核對訂單。\n\n此為虛構電郵範本預覽。',bodyEn:'Hello, the course details for {{student_name}} are ready.\nCourse: {{course_name}}\nAmount: {{amount}}\nPlease review the order in the student portal.\n\nFictional email template preview.'},{id:'email-template-2',nameZh:'上課提醒',nameEn:'Lesson reminder',subjectZh:'Beamal 上課提醒 · {{date}}',subjectEn:'Beamal lesson reminder · {{date}}',bodyZh:'你好，溫馨提示 {{student_name}} 的課堂安排：\n{{course_name}}\n{{date}} · {{time}}\n\n此為虛構提醒範本，不會自動傳送。',bodyEn:'Hello, a reminder of the example lesson for {{student_name}}:\n{{course_name}}\n{{date}} · {{time}}\n\nFictional reminder template; nothing is sent automatically.'},{id:'email-template-3',nameZh:'試堂確認',nameEn:'Trial confirmation',subjectZh:'Beamal 試堂資料 · {{student_name}}',subjectEn:'Beamal trial details · {{student_name}}',bodyZh:'你好，以下為試堂資料範本：\n{{course_name}}\n{{date}} · {{time}}\n\n此為介面預覽，並非真實確認。',bodyEn:'Hello, here is the trial-detail template:\n{{course_name}}\n{{date}} · {{time}}\n\nInterface preview; not an actual confirmation.'},{id:'email-template-4',nameZh:'付款單據',nameEn:'Payment receipt',subjectZh:'Beamal 單據預覽 · {{invoice_number}}',subjectEn:'Beamal receipt preview · {{invoice_number}}',bodyZh:'你好，\n附件名稱為 {{attachment_name}}，供檢視單據樣式。\n\n此為介面預覽，沒有生成 PDF 或傳送任何電郵。',bodyEn:'Hello,\nThe example attachment name is {{attachment_name}}, for reviewing the receipt layout.\n\nInterface preview. No PDF has been generated and no email has been sent.'}];
